window.products.push({"id":1010104,"name":"ARSTPEOE Drawer Dividers with 8 Inserts,16.9-23\", Drawer Dividers for Clothes, Expandable Kitchen Drawer Organizer,Adjustable Drawer Separators for Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PgLkfiI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎【Easy to Install】: Compared to most drawer dividers with latches or built-in springs, it is quick and easy to install, First place the spring in the drawer divider.Then insert the sliding spacer with the rubber pad. Finally, put drawer dividers in the drawer and insert the plug into the hole and , adjust to a suitable position and can be firmly held in place in drawers. You have the flexibility to place small drawer dividers to meet your needs. 💎【Expandable and Adjustable Kitchen Drawer Organizer】: Each Measures 16.9\" x 3.94\" x 0.8\" ; Expands from 16.9\" to 23\" long. 4 pcs Big Drawer Divider Measures 7\" x 3.9\" x 0.2\" .4 pcs Small Drawer Divider Measures 4.7\" x 3.9\" x 0.2\" . Easily adapt compartment spaces to contents with these expandable dividers to create a customized storage solution. 💎【Multipurpose Drawer Dividers】: These drawer organizers can be installed in any drawer of your house or office. For instance - you can install them as safety separator for kitchen silverware and utensils, tableware, sharp knife; drawer organizer for cosmetics on the dressing table; drawer separator for socks, underwear, bra fabrics and other clothes in the wardrobe; drawer dividers for towels in the bathroom and even as bookcase and shelf dividers. 💎【Drawer Dividers That Stay in Place】: Strong spring-loaded design makes them sturdy dividers, with non-slip rubber pads in the end, keeping it stay put all the time and protect your drawers from scratches. 💎【Materials That Won’t Fail You】: Made with heavy duty plastic and ABS material, these white underwear drawer organizers are guaranteed to remain as good as new for a very long time. Contact us if you are unhappy with your purchase for any reason; we will solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PgLkfiI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARSTPEOE","source_asin":"B0BP7N5FVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP7N5FVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP7N5FVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
