window.products.push({"id":1010184,"name":"Mightree Projection Alarm Clock for Bedroom, Digital Alarm Clock with USB Charger, Large LED Mirror Display Radio Alarm Clock, Dual Smart Alarm with P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QzoGNH6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"180° Ajustable Projection & Brightness Control: This digital alarm clock can project on ceiling clearly with a soft red light, which won't glare your eyes at night. When the projection is on, long press and hold the project key \" △/project\" to rotate the projection view to 180°. Besides, this clock is equipped with a high sensitivity sensor, which can ajust the brightness according to the environment. 4 Level brightness (Bright-Medium-Dim-Off) available to set. Large LED Mirror Display: The digital projection alarm clocks is designed with 7.4 inch clear mirror display, even if you are keep away from it also can see the time clearly. It also can be used as a make up miror to convenient for you to take care of dress or makeup. Dual Alarms & Snooze Fuction: This smart clock has double alarm clocks function, which can set two separate time in the same time. It is a great choice for your roomate or partner to set a different wake-up time in the same bedroom.The snooze function allows you to get 5~60 minutes extra sleep time, which is friendly and helpful to heavy sleepers. There are 2 optional alarm sounds and 3 adjustable volume levels to choose. USB Charging Port: The digital alarm clock is designed with USB charger. At the back of clock has a 5V output port for charging mobilephone,tablet and other electronic devices. Unique design, modern and novel looks is attactived by people, it is really a good morning call partner for office worker and students.This radio prjection clock is suitable for bedroom, office or hotel to remind you doing something in a fixed time. （Plug Not Included） FM Radio and Sleep Timer: This compact design alarm clock is not just an alarm clock but also a FM radio, which can search and read from 76.0 Mhz~108Mhz of frequency to hear different shows.You can search a favorite shows and set a sleep timer within 5 ~ 90 mintues to fall asleep, then shut off aumomatically when time is up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QzoGNH6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mightree","source_asin":"B0BRZYLZ9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRZYLZ9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRZYLZ9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
