window.products.push({"id":1010199,"name":"Acliys Fruit Bowl, 3 Tier Ceramic Fruit Basket, 3 Tier Serving Stand Serving Bowl with Metal Rack, Porcelain Kitchen Bowls for Fruit Vegetable Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ItuPtETsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ELEGANT DESIGN】Our fruit bowl with both beauty and practicality, ingenious design, and elegant style, is not only a fruits & cakes & desserts plate, but also the elegant decoration for your sweet home. In aesthetic design, flawless for dining room or table decoration. It also can be a great gift ideal for wedding, friends, or any other party. 【SPACE SAVING & WIDELY USED】This 3-Tier Fruit Bowl is 11.22\" long for the large bowl, 9.06\" long for the medium bowl and 8.07\" long for the small bowl, and the metal stand measures 4.72\" x 12.8\" (L x H). Our ceramic fruit basket is compact in design，can be placed with fruits, vegetables, sugars, snacks and small gadgets as fruit holder. Beautifully designed to serve multi-purpose for any dinner table, weddings, birthday parties, buffet treats, food display tables, baby shower, afternoon tea. 【STURDY & BUILT TO LAST】Each serving bowl is made of high-quality ceramic with smooth hand feel, the original color of the materials will not fade or rust. The shelf is composed of metal, lightweight and beautiful. The edges of the serving bowl are made of irregular lines, round and smooth, without burrs. The anti-slip ball at the bottom of the shelf has been polished smooth, prevent shaking and does not hurt the countertop. 【EASY TO CLEAN &FREE INSTALLATION】These durable porcelain serving bowls are easier to clean than ordinary stainless steel fruit bowls. and are dishwasher, microwave, and freezer safe. The integrated fruit basket stand is a thicker metal frame with good load-bearing capacity, 【Acliys After Sale Service】 100% satisfaction + Free return Acliys is committed to provide unique luxurious quality and affordably-priced jewelry. Please Feel Free To Contact Us Anytime You Need Help, We Will Get You Back Within 24 Hours And Try Our Best To Promise You an Enjoyable Shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ItuPtETsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acliys","source_asin":"B0C6JYCKQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6JYCKQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6JYCKQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
