window.products.push({"id":1010345,"name":"Portmeirion Sophie Conran Biscuit Covered Sugar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31u1mzFWUCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Sophie Conran Collection was designed exclusively for Portmeirion. This collection is as durable and functional as it is beautiful. Sophie is part of the world-famous Conran lifestyle and culinary dynasty. The simplistic and organic nature of this collection makes it perfect for every style and taste. Each beautifully delicate item meets the hard-wearing needs of today's family and culinary experts. Available in White, Bisque and Celadon, the look can be as simple or diverse as your tastes demand. Amazon.com This simple, beautiful, and functional sugar bowl is part of an entire tableware and bakeware collection designed by Sophie Conran, an English food writer with her own gourmet pie company. Conran infuses her namesake tableware with a flowing organic nature and tactile expression, as evidenced by the ridges and dipped rims that recall handcrafted pottery. Made of porcelain expressly for Portmeirion, the collection comes in glossy white with select pieces available in cool blue celadon and a creamy biscuit color. The Sophie Conran sugar bowl is formed in a compellingly rotund shape that harmonizes with the collection's cream jug and teapot. A lip at the rim holds in place the domed lid, which features an unusual knob and a cutout hole for a spoon. The durable, chip-resistant porcelain bowl and lid clean up without fuss in the dishwasher, and also may be used to warm food in a microwave or oven, for example, to liquefy crystallized honey. Combined with the creamer, the set makes a great gift for those who appreciate a rustic yet modern look on the table. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31u1mzFWUCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B000QDLUJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QDLUJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QDLUJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010346,"name":"Murphy by Enovation Controls PowerView PV101-C, Tier 4 Display (78700615)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zBwgK9Z5L._AC_.jpg","description":"The PowerView PV101-C Tier 4 (Euro Stage IV) display is a powerful multifunction tool that enables equipment operators to view standard engine and transmission parameters, as well as active and stored trouble codes on a single, compact screen. It has become the standard for users that need real-time monitoring, full diagnostics and multiple languages. The display can show either a single parameter or a quadrant display showing four parameters simultaneously. Diagnostic capabilities include codes with text translation for the most common fault conditions. The enhanced alarm indicators have ultra-bright alarm and shutdown LED's (amber and red). The following features are now available with the new PV101-C-T4 display: Multiple language options, Sender Input, Five Service Reminders, Select Source Address, and the ability to select CAN bus Data Rate. The display and all connected components can be powered by either 12 or 24-volt systems. Up to 32 components may be linked to the PowerView using a simple daisy chain wire connection scheme using RS485.  The PV101-C-TR will display more than 50 standard SAE J1939 parameters broadcast by engine and transmission ECU's, as well as displaying active and ECU-stored faults with text description for diagnosing equipment malfunctions. The display has simple connections to optional components. It is compatible with all our current J1939 gages, and is also fully backward compatible with the PV100 and PV101-A. The new PV101-C-T4 display (78700615) directly replaces the PV101-C display (78700439).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zBwgK9Z5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Murphy by Enovation Controls","source_asin":"B07VLCVG31","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLCVG31","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLCVG31","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
