window.products.push({"id":1010368,"name":"VEHHE 22 Pack Reusable Storage Bags (4 Gallon Ziplock Bags + 9 Reusable Snack Bags +9 Sandwich Bags) Leakproof Food Bags For Lunch Travel Cosmetic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qY7Hz0YiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Silicone Material & Reusable】The reusable storage bags are made of food-grade silicone and are BPA-free. Not only environmentally friendly but also durable, to help you effectively save the additional repeated and waste. These reusable bags can reduce the usage of white plastic bags, will be protect the ocean and turtles. 【Diverse Size & Widely Used】The reusable gallon bags are 11 inches x 11.8 inches,the reusable sandwich bags 10.2 inches x 7.8 inches, and the reusable snack bags 8.6 inches x 4.6 inches. Different sizes are designed to meet your various needs, and can store vegetables, fruits, meat, snacks, cosmetics and stationery. And the food bags can be folded and stored easily, especially when traveling or picnicking. 【Leakproof & Freezer Safe】The reusable freezer bags adopt thickening design and upgraded closures sealing technology, which can effectively isolate the external air, keep the food fresh, and prevent the food from discoloration, drying and deterioration. The silicone bags can be used at temperatures below 70 ℃(158 °F), making them ideal for frozen fruits, vegetables, baby food and meat products. 【Easy to Clean】Reusable lunch bag should only be washed by hand or with a cup brush. After washing, please open the seal and place it on the top of the cup or the shelf to dry them before reuse. It is not suitable to put them in the dishwasher or microwave as they can damage the zip rand texture of the leakproof lunch bags. 【Set Includes and Customer Guaranteed】If you buy the reusable storage bags, you will receive 6 gallon bags, 8 sandwich bags, and 8 snack bags. If you receive silicone food bags, have any problems, can timely contact us, we will give you a ideal resolution in the first time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qY7Hz0YiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEHHE","source_asin":"B09CG8QJJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CG8QJJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CG8QJJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
