window.products.push({"id":1010433,"name":"CandleNScent Formal Dinner Taper Candles, Candle Sticks, Dripless Candles - 8 Inch (Color Variations) unscented | Pink Color | 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X7meER5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CandleNScent Formal Dinner Taper Candles, Candle Sticks, Dripless Candles BEST QUALITY FORMAL DINNER CANDLES: American Made Full Burning Paraffin Unscented Candle. Made With Superior Wax For A Clean And Steady Flame. Lead Free Wick Made Of 100% Natural Fibers For A Consistent Smokeless Flame Throughout The Candle Burn. SPECIFICATIONS: Full 8 Inch Long Candles | Available in Pack Of 4 or 12 Pieces | Color: Pink Taper Candles | 7/8 Inches Diameter. Holds Tight In All Standard Candlesticks And Glass Tapered Candles - Candle Holders With Our Special Designed Base. CANDLENSCENT TAPER CANDLE COMPARED: ✔️ Our Taper Candle Has A Base Especially Designed To Hold Tight Into Your Candelabra Or Candlestick. ✔️ Our Tall Pink Candles Give A Full 8 Inches Of Candle Wax And Yes! That Extra Inch Makes A Huge Difference. SET THE MOOD: Imagine How These White Dripless Taper Candles Will Enhance Your Dinner, Party, And Event By Creating The Perfect Ambiance With This Tall Candle's Soft Lighting. Add Even More Height By Placing It Into Any Standard Candlestick Holder. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – CandleNScent products are carefully produced to give you the best experience with your candle. You will love the quality, burn time and versatility. Since everyone’s experience with candles are different, we offer a simple guarantee. Love it! Or send seller a single email for refund. See our full collection by clicking on the brand name above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X7meER5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CandleNScent","source_asin":"B07V6MTJQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V6MTJQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V6MTJQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010434,"name":"20 Pcs Black Silverware Set, Stainless Steel Flatware Set for 4, Food-Grade Cutlery Set, Mirror Polished Tableware Eating Utensils Set for Home Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zpg8VlCXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【20 PIECES BLACK SILVERWARE SET FOR 4】: This flatware set contains 4 dinner knives, 4 dinner forks, 4 salad forks, 4 dinner spoons and 4 dessert spoons. Great for home, restaurant, hotel, buffet, gathering, wedding, camping, party and entertaining. If you are going to have a picnic or a party , then this set of tableware can not only meet your requirements, but also make your dinner full of design. ✅【HIGH QUALITY AND DURABLE】: This silverware set is made of FOOD GRADE stainless steel which is very durable, corrosion resistant, rust-proof, non-toxic, BPA free, no metal aftertaste. Meanwhile, its sturdiness ensures that it will not bend easily providing you with long - term use. ✅【UNIQUE BLACK LOOK】: The mysterious black appearance stands out from ordinary silverware, making it look more retro and vintage, just like a noble flatware used in the manor, smooth surface and fine workmanship make it more luxurious and create an elegant, noble and luxurious dining atmosphere. There is no need to worry about fading or cracking, as this is a metal layer from vacuum plating technology. If you want to be different in tableware, you won’t miss it. ✅【PROPER WEIGHT AND ERGONOMIC HANDLE】: Unlike other brands, the curvature of our utensil handles is designed according to the posture of the hand, and the appropriate weight and perfect balance are added to ensure maximum comfort during use that avoids you feel tired. Moreover, the smooth edges ensure safety and no scratches. ✅【USE AND CARE】: It is recommended to wash by hand, wipe dry before storing. Do not use wire brushes, hard sponges or clean cloths and other hard materials cleaning tools to avoid damage the silverware. ✅【EXCELLENT SERVICE】: We have a very efficient after-sales service team, If you have any questions about our black silverware set, Please feel free to contact us, We will try our best to give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zpg8VlCXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WISKEMA","source_asin":"B0C7GMC1R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7GMC1R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7GMC1R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
