window.products.push({"id":1010484,"name":"Merax Wood Triple Bunk Bed Frame with Drawers and Guardrails for Kids and Teens, No Box Spring Needed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Je9Nh27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect space-saving solution for multi-child families. A full size bed combined with two twin size beds, this triple bunk bed provides a convenient and flexible arrangement option for large families and sleepovers by taking advantage of vertical space. A gray finish enhances the smooth lines and add a contemporary feel to any room set aside for multiples to sleep. Crafted with pine wood and plywood, this triple bunk bed is sturdy and durable to withstand the test of time. The angled ladder allows you to easily access the upper bed. Sturdy guardrails protect you as you sleep through the night. Ample storage space is provided by the two large drawers under lower beds. This set works perfectly as a stacked full over twin & twin unit, or divided into three separate beds. You can choose the combination method based on your own needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Je9Nh27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B09GXDFVXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXDFVXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXDFVXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010485,"name":"Expandable Cover Included with Twin 3 Inch Serene Foam Advanced Supportive Air Technology Mattress Topper Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqiitobmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Starting today memory foam is obsolete. Introducing serene foam, todays technology that will cost effectively revolutionize the next generation in comfort. The comfort engineers at carpenter foam devised a way to pack the attributes of high density foam into a cost effective product. One that actually offers additional benefits to further enhance comfort. What makes this possible is serenes new: Supportive Air Technology. Which utilizes billions of microscopic air capsules to provide outstanding support while dramatically reducing pressure each of these tiny cells acts as an individual shock absorber cushion releasing air independantly as pressure increases. This independant response help ensure individualized comfort and support. Studies show tht serene foam greatly reduces pressure to the hip and back area when compared to traditional bedding materials and even high end memory foam with up to 4 times more peak pressure reduction. This reduction in pressure creates more comfort. The exceptionally fine cell structure give serene foam a superior feel and performance. Serene also decreases motion transfer. Conventional foam optimizes support lifting consistently to give your body support at all times creating lots of energy. Memory foam provides zero gravity support absorbing any energy that is transfered to it. Serene provides the best of both worlds. Memory foam used to be good and now serene has been created as even better. The next generation in foam innovation. Dynamic fatigue results have proven that serene foam is exceptionally durable. Serene outperforms memory foam with the same density and holds up just as well as premium high density memory foam. Serene foam provides that comfortable restorative sleep night after night. All the attributes your looking for and more can now be found right here with serene foam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqiitobmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carpenter","source_asin":"B01GJHZ8YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GJHZ8YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GJHZ8YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010486,"name":"Housewarming Gifts, Engraved Wood Cutting Board with Side Handles, and Juice Grooves House Warming Present for New Home (Bamboo)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mYGXubwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Housewarming Gift: Our custom cutting boards are the perfect gift for both family and friends. Whether you're displaying this one-of-a-kind piece as art in your kitchen or prepping the family dinner, this wood cutting board provides a unique and personal touch. Unique laser engraving process, designed for decor and use. Safe & Functional of Small Cutting Board: The 12.9x 9'' bamboo cutting board is sturdy enough for vigorous chopping, and it doesn’t hog kitchen space—but it’s also lightweight and portable for serving, with easy-to-grip tapered edges so you can pick the cutting board up effortlessly. Ideal for slicing bread, fruits, vegetables, meats, steaks, cheeses, or as a serving tray. Juice Groove & Inner Handle Design: It features a beautifully striking wood grain design, meant to leave a lasting impression on your guests. Surrounded built-in juice groove is close to the edge to maximize the cutting area while perfectly catching excess liquids without overflowing onto the countertop, meanwhile, the grooves are not too narrow to clean. The inner handles are on the back taking no cutting areas and don't take up much space. Knife-Friendly Surface: Made of acacia wood, with the perfect balance of hardness. Our small boards are gentle on your knives and won't dull the blades. Now your sharp knives and our cutting boards will be good companions that get along well with each other. Sustainable : Acacia is prized for its rich, beautiful grain and durability but also happens to be one of the most sustainable and fast-growing woods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mYGXubwDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bnesi","source_asin":"B0B1Y9KD2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Y9KD2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Y9KD2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010487,"name":"Best Home Fashion Mix & Match Tulle Sheer Lace and Blackout Curtain Set – Stainless Steel Nickel Grommet Top – Dusty Pink – 52\"W x 96\"L – (2 Curtains ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jrdS+xtJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing Best Home Fashion Tulle Lace & solid blackout mix & match curtain set! this enchanting window treatment combination features a dreamy and romantic look guaranteed to liven up any home decor. The two contrasting fabrics blend together effortlessly, bringing glamour and elegance. Let in natural light with the Tulle sheer Lace alone or layer it with the blackout curtain to obstruct light while adding style and privacy. Dress your windows with confidence with our Tulle Lace & solid blackout mix & match curtain set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jrdS+xtJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Home Fashion","source_asin":"B01NBGEWFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBGEWFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBGEWFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010488,"name":"Crossroads Frosted Pearl Half Pint, 4-inch Height","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61530NP-aGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It Starts with a Flame Crossroads Original Designs is a family-owned and -operated manufacturer of scented candles, reed diffusers, room sprays, framed art and home decor accessories. Since its founding in Bucyrus, Ohio, in 2003, the company has continually reported notable growth, even during troubling economic times, something the company's leaders attribute as much to their customer-centric business philosophy as their product line. \"From the beginning, we really set out with a main focus of creating unique, quality products and giving great customer service at a great price. We started with those core values and stuck with them over the years,\" says president/owner Jason McMullen, who launched the business with brother and current vice president/owner Justin McMullen. \"We were just looking to make candles, and we built it from zero to over 7,000 customers today.\" The Crossroads credo of adhering to a vision is echoed by Justin McMullen. \"One of the things we try to do is build a relationship and partnership with customers. I don't mean just receiving an order and shipping it as quickly as possible, we do that, but we also want that customer to be a customer forever and create value for them,\" he says. Part of this value is providing merchants with selling tips, marketing strategies and display ideas, among other merchandising and support tools. Wherever the road may go, Crossroads will continue to lead the way and outshine the competition by being innovative and forward-thinking, while at the same time sticking to the very small town values the company was founded on. If you are looking for high-quality, clean-burning candles with rich, true-to-life fragrance, we invite you to try our authentic, made in America goods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61530NP-aGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crossroads","source_asin":"B09X6PJCHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X6PJCHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X6PJCHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
