window.products.push({"id":1010665,"name":"Bentgo®️ Glass Leak-Proof Food Storage Set - 8 Piece Stackable 1-Compartment Meal Prep Containers & Airtight Locking Lids, Reusable & BPA-Free - Micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dddmwGnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A HOME ESSENTIAL: This 8-piece set of glass food storage containers is perfect for any new homeowner, cook, newlywed, and parent. Make 4 different-sized meals, like breakfast, lunch, dinner, and snacks, and store them away in your fridge or freezer. Heat, eat, and clean them in the top shelf of your dishwasher, then nest the containers back in your pantry to save precious cabinet space! DURABLE GLASS LIDS: We crafted the base and the lid in transparent glass so you can easily see what’s inside at a glance. Made of high-quality, borosilicate glass with a tempered glass lid, these durable, yet surprisingly lightweight, glass meal prep containers are better for the environment as they help cut back on single-use plastics and you can reuse them again and again. LEAK-PROOF DESIGN: Made with a 100% airtight seal, you can pack any type of juicy foods and the containers will not leak. Add soups, yogurt, fruit salads, sauce, leftovers and more and take them with you on-the-go with the confidence that you won’t have any spills or messes. SECURE LOCKING CLIPS: Keep your food fresh all day long with the easy-open locking clips that snap right into place. Along with the stain and odor-resistant design, each airtight food storage container will maintain the taste and smell of your food so it’s as delicious as when you made it. WHAT YOU GET: Glass food storage containers with lids: 1 small, 1 medium, 1 large, and 1 extra-large container, and custom-fit lids for each, plus a user manual along with Bentgo’s industry-leading 2-Year Warranty. Our customer support team provides daily quality service and peace of mind to millions worldwide all from a proven brand you can trust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dddmwGnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bentgo","source_asin":"B0BQSQ57XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQSQ57XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQSQ57XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
