window.products.push({"id":1010845,"name":"Pheebs Travel Neck Pillow - 100% Pure Memory Foam - Perfect for Long Airplane Flights - 360 Head & Neck Support - Foldable & Easy to Carry - Super Sof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8k9g0T+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tired of bland travel pillows that just don’t work? Although there are many neck pillows out there, this one is the first to fulfill your need for both practicality and glamour. The design and color make it a great option for those in search of fashion, lifestyle and adventure. Scientifically Designed for Ultimate Comfort Whether you’re driving or flying on an airplane to your next vacation destination, our travel neck pillow is perfect for short or long trips and will provide unrivaled support and stability for the entirety of your travels. Ergonomic and Compact Your travel experience will not be bothered by not having enough space to pack your beloved pillow. Our folding mechanism and carry bag assure that wherever you’re heading, Pheebs will be already packed and ready to go. Anti-stress Design We know that sleeping in airplanes can sometimes be a nightmare. Our memory foam neck pillow is scientifically designed to help prevent muscle tension or strains ensuring your neck will never go stiff again. Dual Fabric Cover Our neck pillow stands out by perfectly combining two types of fabrics, a silky smooth and breathable mesh for the inner part that prevents your neck from overheating and an ultra-soft velour exterior that provides a magic touch. Money Back Guarantee Our small business is committed to providing you with the best customer experience possible, so you can rest assured knowing that we’ve got your back. Important! Do not wash the memory foam, just the cover.Avoid direct sun exposure. Stay relaxed and refreshed wherever you’re going by having Pheebs by your side.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8k9g0T+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vilmio","source_asin":"B0772T6H8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0772T6H8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0772T6H8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
