window.products.push({"id":1010862,"name":"Qbedding Extra-Heavy Double Layered (400 GSM X 2) Reversible Velvet Plush Blanket (Twin, Lime)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pcfLlR7bL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Qbedding takes Quality seriously. The best polyester material, coated in German anti-static dye, and beefed up in all directions. Unlike the typical blankets that barely fits the mattress corner to corner, we Oversize them so you can roll around in bed all you want. At 400 GSM, you'd be hard pressed to find a better product among our competitors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pcfLlR7bL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qbedding","source_asin":"B01MYS2LZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYS2LZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYS2LZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010863,"name":"Irish Harp bone china mug - Irish gift designed in Galway Ireland","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pyGxFE4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An Irish house always has a constant stream of tea being made in the kitchen. Therefore it's very important to have your own perfect cup. We have a selection of beautifully made Bone China cups.This collection of Irish Weave Mugs are beautifully illustrated. The harp has been a political emblem in Ireland for generations. The origins of its usage has unfortunately been lost but through oral and written traditions but we know of its presence from at least the sixth century AD. Even Brian Boru (941-1014AD) High King of Ireland played this exquisite instrument just as all the gentry did during the Gaelic Lordship of Ireland which ended in 1607.The harp is the emblem currently used on such things as our coins the flag on the Leinster flag and is the emblem of Guinness Black Stout. Therefore there is no denying the omnipresence of this elegant icon throughout Irish politics and history.The print is written in Irish script style similar to that in the famous Book of Kells. Further similarities to this are the colours of the border and the Celtic Knotwork patterns. This mug is so beautiful it could easily be used in a display case. It is also ideal for holding your perfect cup of tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pyGxFE4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Tara","source_asin":"B007JWJU62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007JWJU62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007JWJU62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1010864,"name":"World's Most Challenging Coloring Poster - Giant Size 32\"x 22\" Inches (Great for Family Time, Adults, Kids, Classrooms, Care Facilities and Group Acti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qDqyUrXQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We’ve done it! Presenting the World's Most Challenging Coloring Poster! A witty puzzle within a detailed, intricate coloring design! The illustrator took over 6 months to create this incredibly detailed design of a lad standing in the middle of the messiest room you have ever seen. Every trinket you can imagine (even the kitchen sink) is piled from floor to ceiling. With so many unique and fun objects to discover and color, you won't even put this poster down long enough to ask \"Where did I put that?\" Which begs the question (yes, another one), what is the title of this poster all about? Might there be an answer to, 'Where Did I Put That?'. Why, yes, of course there is!! It will only be revealed to people who are up to the ultimate challenge to color this design. Good luck!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qDqyUrXQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stuff2Color","source_asin":"B00EZ7K022","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1010864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EZ7K022","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EZ7K022","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
